ges.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12um7.jpg"}, {"id": 1812608, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12um8.jpg"}, {"id": 1812609, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12um9.jpg"}, {"id": 1812610, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12uma.jpg"}, {"id": 1812611, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12umb.jpg"}, {"id": 1812612, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12umc.jpg"}, {"id": 1812613, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12umd.jpg"}], "slug": "cavevox", "storyline": "In the Western Kingdom of Tavernar, on the continent of Avelir, beyond the mountains, a path was forged to the magical forests. These forests became a new frontier for the development of magic and research. It was there that the deepest dungeon ever known was discovered \u2014 and several factions established their bases above it, beginning their descent into its abyss.\n\nYou are one of the adventurers who decided to step into the forgotten darkness, where traps, monsters, and ancient secrets lurk in the shadows. CaveVox is a first-person voxel-style roguelike set in a fantasy dungeon. Brutal. Atmospheric. Unpredictable.\n\nNo two runs are the same \u2014 corridors, rooms, and items are procedurally generated to make every expedition unique. Explore step by step, level up, find items, avoid deadly traps, and battle the terrifying creatures that dwell in the dark.", "summary": "CaveVox \u2014 the ONLY first-person voxel roguelike with permadeath. Live as your character: descend into a deadly dungeon, fight monsters, gain loot, and return to the surface for your next descent. Each expedition is unique \u2014 solo or with a party of adventurers, your choices shape your journey.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cavevox", "videos": [{"id": 160171, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "vKBG4aduIz0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKBG4aduIz0", "title": "Demo Trailer | CaveVox", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vKBG4aduIz0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164024, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "NQreD6ihJjM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NQreD6ihJjM", "title": "Demo Gameplay | CaveVox", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NQreD6ihJjM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}